9. Main Pessimistic Lock Modes
For fresher interviews, know these three names:
PESSIMISTIC_READ
LockModeType.PESSIMISTIC_READ
Conceptually:
Protect the row against conflicting modifications while allowing behavior consistent with a read lock, depending on database support.
PESSIMISTIC_WRITE ⭐
LockModeType.PESSIMISTIC_WRITE
Think:
"I'm going to modify this data. Acquire a stronger lock."
This is the most important one for you to remember.
PESSIMISTIC_FORCE_INCREMENT
LockModeType.PESSIMISTIC_FORCE_INCREMENT
This combines pessimistic locking with version handling and forces a version increment for versioned entities.

